 please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThis PR aims to make controls a little easier to understand and modify. It does not close any open issues or proposals, as far as I know. I think it's trivial enough and a clear improvement. But I can open a proposal if it's somehow controversial.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\nThis PR mostly shows suffixes that were missing, and adjusts ranges for cutoff sliders. For `AudioEffectPhaser`, I removed useless decimals in cutoff sliders, and adjusted precision in other sliders:\r\n- Rate: from `0.001` to `0.01` (large range, does not need this much precision)\r\n- Feedback: from `0.1` to `0.01` (short range, needs more precision)\r\n- Depth: from `0.1` to `0.01` (short range, needs more precision)\r\n\r\nRelated PR: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107052\r\n\r\nQuestion: I think it could be good to add a multiplication sign `×` as a suffix to numbers that are factors. Some `gain` values are additive, but some are factors. Thoughts?","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","descrip